      <description>&lt;p&gt;A Network has a different set of nodes, &lt;a href=&#34;https://merak.run/terms/v/validator/&#34;&gt;validators&lt;/a&gt;, systems, etc, and usually &lt;a href=&#34;https://merak.run/terms/t/token/&#34;&gt;tokens&lt;/a&gt; that are used for pay the gas fees for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some projects decide to go for one network or another based on the gas fees or features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are several known networks like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;network&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/thead&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Ethereum&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Cosmos&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Aleph&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Gnosis/xDai&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Binance Smart Chain&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Polygon (Matic)&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And many projects based on that ecosystem&lt;/p&gt;</description>
